hifiberry-btaudio (1.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Convert to pure metapackage - no files installed, only dependencies
  * Move all scripts, services, and configs to 'old' directory for future use
  * Simplified package that only ensures Bluetooth audio dependencies are installed
  * Dependencies: libspa-0.2-bluetooth, bluez, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, pipewire-alsa, wireplumber
  * Removed Python dependencies as no scripts are installed
  * Simplified postinst/prerm scripts for metapackage operation

 -- HiFiBerry Team <support@hifiberry.com>  Sun, 13 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000

hifiberry-btaudio (1.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Convert to metapackage with required Bluetooth audio dependencies
  * Add libspa-0.2-bluetooth, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, pipewire-alsa, wireplumber
  * Disable web service installation (can be re-enabled later)
  * Rename discoverable service file to include 'discoverable' in filename
  * Remove web API components from default installation
  * Ensure all necessary components for Bluetooth audio are installed

 -- HiFiBerry Team <support@hifiberry.com>  Sun, 13 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000

